#19801
A Steep Path~
You stand on a very steep but wide path, covered with footprints and caravan
tracks, suggesting heavy use.  The path continues to the west, but turns past
some jagged mountain walls, making it impossible to see what lies ahead.  A
vulture circles overhead, perhaps implying that some who travel here do not
come back alive.
~
