#19803
A Wide, Smooth Path~
The path, heading north and south, bears signs of much use, including caravan
tracks and animal footprints.  It stretches about six feet in width, allowing
easy travel for a trade caravan and safe passage through the perilous
mountains.  To the far north, there appears to be some kind of large structure,
and to the south the path continues deeper into jagged terrain.
~
