#19806
A Small, Serene Lake~
Fortunately, the water broke your fall, rather than some jagged rocks that
could have been down here instead.  You seem to be in some kind of mountain
lake, surrounded by tall cliffs.  In fact, there seems to be no way of climbing
out of here.  The water looks rather safe and peaceful, however, but something
seems to be moving underneath...
~
198 101 0 0 0 6
D1
A boulder lies in front of what looks to be a small cave opening.
~
boulder~
