#19807
A Hidden Cave~
This cave is obviously well-hidden from the outside, as its opening is barely
above water.  However, it rises up here, providing dry land to unfortunate
visitors.  Through a small opening in the west, the water gets deeper and
deeper, leading into a relatively small lake surrounded by cliffs.
~
198 300 0 0 0 0
D3
A boulder lies in front of a small opening.
~
boulder~
