#19811
Southern Gates of Tavlyn~
The heavily guarded city gates, rising up almost twenty feet, protect the city
from unwanted visitors.  The wall has a scaffold which providers a perfect
defensive position for archers, while legions of dwarven guards stand before
the gates.  To the north, a road continues deeper into Tavlyn.
