#19812
Atop the Southern Gate~
You are atop the southern gate, in a specially-designed scaffold for defensive
archers.  The location is just perfect, with the city wall blocking incoming
arrows, and niches for city archers to shoot through.  It would be an
unfortunate situation for an invader.
~
