#19874
An Obsidian Chamber~
The mines have led to this chamber deep beneath the ground, made entirely of
obsidian.  The mines lie far, far above, impossible to reach from here.  The
chamber is rather small, but certainly less chlostrophobic than the tight mine
shafts.  You sense that something evil lives far down here.
~
198 121 0 0 0 0
D4
~
~
0 0 19873
S
#19875
An Obsidian Hallway~
You have appeared in a hallway also made only of obsidian.  There appears to be
no way back to the familiarity of the chamber or the mines, and something tells
you danger is near.  Walls surround you in all directions except north, where
a huge group of undead, certainly many more than one could fight, have gathered
to block your passage.  Together, perhaps, the wise man and the strong man can
conquer.
~
198 105 0 0 0 0
S
#19876
A Bone-Filled Lair~
You are in a massive room, perhaps a hundred feet wide and a hundred long,
filled almost entirely with a layer of bones, from those of animals to those of
humanoids.  You have a feeling that strong adventurers have come here before,
and never made it back.
~
